<div class="ta-container ta-page ta-page-narrow ta-privacy">
    <h1 class="ta-page-headline">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="ta-page-sub">We collect a little personal information to run your account. Here is what it is, who sees it, and how to have it deleted.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Your account.</strong> The email address you sign up with, and your name if you give it. Your password goes to Microsoft Entra, which runs our sign-in; we never see it.</li>
        <li><strong>An account ID.</strong> Microsoft assigns it when you sign up, so we know it’s you when you come back.</li>
        <li><strong>Two cookies, both needed for the site to work.</strong> One keeps you signed in; the other protects our forms from forgery. We use no advertising or tracking cookies.</li>
        <li><strong>What every website receives.</strong> Your IP address, your browser, and the pages you ask for. Our hosting provider, Microsoft Azure, uses them to serve the site and keep it secure.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we don’t collect yet</h2>
    <p>Today, Tangent Atlas doesn’t connect to your bank, broker, card or retirement accounts. Before it does, we’ll update this page, and you’ll choose each account you link.</p>

    <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Microsoft</strong> stores and processes your information for us, through Entra (sign-in) and Azure (hosting).</li>
        <li><strong>Google</strong> supplies the site’s fonts, so your browser shares your IP address with Google when it fetches them.</li>
        <li>We don’t sell or rent your information, and we don’t use it for advertising.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>For as long as you have an account. Ask us to close it, and we’ll delete your information, except anything the law requires us to keep.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>To see, correct or delete your information, write to <a href="mailto:privacy@tangentatlas.com">privacy@tangentatlas.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If this changes, we’ll post the new version here with its date.</p>

    <p class="ta-caption">Last updated October 23, 2026.</p>
</div>
